  "body": "### Description\n\n[Spec](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3profileuserid) does not provide for authentication. But it is needed to use the endpoint.  \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nGET /_matrix/client/v3/profile/ without access_token\r\n\n\n### Homeserver\n\nown\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.73\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDocker (matrixdotorg/synapse)\n\n### Database\n\npostgreSQL\n\n### Workers\n\nSingle process\n\n### Platform\n\nK8s\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\"errcode\":\"M_MISSING_TOKEN\",\"error\":\"Missing access token\"\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
